@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam participantBorderColor #1E293B
skinparam participantFontColor #0F172A
skinparam participantFontStyle bold

title Figure 4.2.1 — End-to-End Operational Sequence Diagram for IntelliShield SDN

actor "User\n(Admin/Analyst)" as Admin #E0E7FF
participant "SOC Dashboard\n(FastAPI UI :8080)" as UI #EFF6FF
participant "SDN Controller\n(flow_monitor)" as Controller #F0FDF4
participant "OpenFlow Switch\n(Mininet OVS Fabric)" as Switch #FEF3C7
participant "Detection Engine\n(Entropy+ML+SSL)" as Detect #F5F3FF
participant "Correlation & Fusion\n(R4 & R6 Engines)" as Fusion #FDF2F8
participant "Verification Gate\n(R7 Multi-Stage)" as Verify #FFFBEB
participant "Mitigation & Alerts\n(FlowBlocker+R5/R8)" as Mitigate #FEE2E2

autonumber 1

== Phase 1: Authentication & Telemetry Polling ==
Admin -> UI: Open dashboard
activate Admin
activate UI
Admin -> UI: Login (credentials)
UI -> UI: Validate credentials & session token
UI --> Admin: Login success (JWT token)

Admin -> UI: Start monitoring session
UI -> Controller: Subscribe to telemetry stream (:8080 API)
activate Controller
Controller -> Switch: Send OFPPortStatsRequest & OFPFlowStatsRequest
activate Switch
Switch --> Controller: Return flow & port statistics (OFPStatsReply)
deactivate Switch
Controller -> Controller: Extract 15-D feature vector (FeatureBuilder)

== Phase 2: Multi-Layer Detection Pipeline ==
Controller -> Detect: Forward telemetry for detection
activate Detect
Detect -> Detect: Compute Shannon Entropy (5 dimensions)
Detect -> Detect: Predict ML status & confidence (IF + DT ensemble)
Detect -> Detect: SSL Autoencoder reconstruction MSE
Detect --> Controller: Detection results (ML, Entropy, SSL)
deactivate Detect

== Phase 3: Cross-Layer Correlation & Collaborative Fusion ==
Controller -> Fusion: Send signals for cross-layer correlation
activate Fusion
Fusion -> Fusion: Correlate IP/port co-occurrence (R4 Engine)
Fusion -> Fusion: Multi-primary collaborative fusion (R6 Engine)
Fusion --> Controller: Fused decision (ATTACK / SUSPICIOUS / NORMAL)
deactivate Fusion

== Phase 4: Multi-Stage Verification Gate (R7) ==
Controller -> Verify: Submit candidate for multi-stage verification
activate Verify
Verify -> Verify: Evaluate warmup status & streak confirmation (R7)
Verify --> Controller: Verification result: ATTACK confirmed (mitigation_eligible=True)
deactivate Verify

== Phase 5: Automated OpenFlow Mitigation & Alert Persistence ==
Controller -> Mitigate: Dispatch mitigation action
activate Mitigate
Mitigate -> Mitigate: Determine surgical match (FLOW_PAIR / SRC_MAC)
Mitigate -> Switch: Install OFPFlowMod DROP rule (priority=100, hard_timeout)
activate Switch
Switch --> Mitigate: DROP rule active on data plane (packets dropped)
deactivate Switch
Mitigate -> Mitigate: Generate XAI feature importance & RCA report (R5)
Mitigate -> Mitigate: Store incident JSONL & dispatch alert email (R8)
Mitigate --> Controller: Mitigation & alerting acknowledgement
deactivate Mitigate

== Phase 6: SOC Observability & Operator Management ==
Controller --> UI: Push real-time event & mitigated telemetry (WebSocket)
UI --> Admin: Display attack alert, XAI explanation & flow stats on UI

Admin -> UI: Inspect blocked flows & RCA report
UI -> Controller: Fetch active block list & RCA details
Controller --> UI: Return active block list & RCA data
UI --> Admin: Display RCA explanation & flow stats

Admin -> UI: Logout
UI --> Admin: End session & close socket
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin
deactivate Controller

@enduml

